 some very exciting news on the way soon so keep your eyes peeled for more announcements 👀 -Bubblebird Studio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T17:09:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706691607","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3216520-1841579228675747","game_id":"steam-3216520","kind":"update","title":"Demo 0.31.0 Patch","summary":"Hi!The first patch for Sandcastle Demo is available! The main improvement is the water simulation: digging holes won't make water appear from nowhere anymore, and in general, the amount of water stays much more stable now!I've also reduced the speed at which the sand collapses by default! The sun intensity and clouds will now also affect how quickly the sand dries.Here is the full list of changes:Improved: Removed cursor toggle hotkey, changed HUD visibility toggle hotkey to F8Fixed: Water simul","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T14:52:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228675747","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3216520-1840310314342344","game_id":"steam-3216520","kind":"announcement","title":"First demo out now!","summary":"Hello beach lovers!I’m so excited to announce that Sandcastle’s first demo is OUT NOW! You can check out our very special demo trailer here:I can’t wait for you all to dive in, but first I’d like to say a huuuuuuggeeeee thank you for 185k wishlists! I’m so amazed that so many of you have found my game!Secondly, a big thank you to the Wholesome team for including Sandcastle in the Wholesome Games Steam Celebration this week! Be sure to go check out all the other lovely titles!Okay now you can go ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-06T16:01:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314342344","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3216520-1839041357038288","game_id":"steam-3216520","kind":"announcement","title":"First Sandcastle Demo Launching August 6th!","summary":"Hey everyone! A quick note before we get into it to say, THANK YOU SO MUCH FOR 165K WISHLISTS! We can’t believe how many of you have found our little game ♥️ We also recently reached over 4.5 million views on Instagram, which is just mind blowing! We can’t wait to share more with you.Speaking of more, we’re super happy to announce that Sandcastle’s first ever demo is launching on August 6th! We’re so excited for you all to dive in and to see your sandy creations 🏰Here's what you can look forward","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-28T13:19:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839041357038288","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3216520-1836506165565804","game_id":"steam-3216520","kind":"announcement","title":"A HUGE thankyou on 100k wishlists, and some more exciting news!","summary":"Hi everyone! It's been a bit of a whirlwind since we announced Sandcastle a few months ago, and there's been some exciting things happening behind the scenes we wanted to share with you all! Firstly, this week we crossed 100,000 wishlists, which is crazy to us! The reception ever since we set the steam page live has been unbelievable, and we can't thank you all enough for your support ♥ Secondly, we're super happy to reveal that we've signed a publishing deal with the team at Future Friends Game","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-01T15:45:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165565804","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3216520-1832700592799214","game_id":"steam-3216520","kind":"announcement","title":"A drop in the Ocean Fest","summary":"It's time for Sandcastle's first Steam fest: The Ocean Fest! Let's make some waves!I'm excited to say that I'm still adding plenty of new elements to the game: new tools, new collectables, new features. Join our discord for a deep dive into Sandcastle's dev! I regularly post new and exclusive content!And of course, don't forget to wishlist the game!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-05-18T17:38:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1832700592799214","verified_at":"2026-10-20T10:47:18Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3216520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:09Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3216520":"2026-10-26T10:17:09Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3216520":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:08Z"},"4894830":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:09Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:09Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T10:17:09Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3216520","app_id":3216520,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:12Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"